		class PositionInfo {position[]={0,0,-4};};
		title="Persistent-object minimal example. A stable key plus this object saves every supported field: cargo, damage, fuel, ammunition/pylons and position. Leave the call directly in the object init; do not add isServer. It operates only when persistence is enabled and server INIDBI2 is available. Use the Full example when only selected fields should persist. Wiki: https://github.com/AdamWaldie/WaldosMissionPack/wiki/Optional-Feature-Systems#persistence";
